WEBVTT

00:02:27.121 --> 00:02:32.246
lead and live today, navigating
career turbulence,

00:02:33.079 --> 00:02:35.538
thanks to Morgan Stanley for
sponsoring this episode.

00:02:43.621 --> 00:02:45.829
You know what turbulence feels
like on an airplane.

00:02:46.163 --> 00:02:49.079
You had some nasty wind and everything
is out of your control.

00:02:49.829 --> 00:02:52.538
You've probably faced that kind of
turbulence in your career, too,

00:02:52.954 --> 00:02:54.621
when your job, your workplace

00:02:54.621 --> 00:02:57.246
or your industry is changing
dramatically around you

00:02:57.413 --> 00:02:59.163
and you feel powerless to shape it.